From 8462d5d1272c1a96d079485ad4165bf2f4fff120 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Galih Tama <galpt@v.recipes>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 07:43:40 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/48] v4.6-gpu: GPU virtual time scheduling, KERNEL vtime
 boost, idle-start, deferred accounting, em dash fix

Includes timeout path UAF fix: clear infinity_entity under job_list_lock
in drm_sched_job_timedout() when the job is temporarily removed from
pending_list, and fix checkpatch brace spacing.

Signed-off-by: Galih Tama <galpt@v.recipes>
---
